---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
const pageTitle = "fun | allen";
---

<SiteLayout title={pageTitle}>
	<h1>fun</h1>
	<ul class="fun-list">
		<li>
			<p>
				<a href="https://x.com/allenysu/status/2027191570496397809?s=20" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">won $16k USD cash</a>
				as the first-place prize at the
				<a href="https://luma.com/2pbif8t9" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">humans&amp; hackathon</a>,
				competing solo and building <strong><a href="https://github.com/allensu02/Crew" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Crew</a></strong>.
			</p>
			<p>
				AI clones for employees, focused on secure, policy-first access to company knowledge
				across tools like Slack, GitHub, and more.
			</p>
			<div class="judges">
				<p class="judges-label">judges:</p>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="https://joannejang.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Joanne Jang</a> (Core Auto, previously OpenAI)</li>
					<li><a href="https://x.com/gharik" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Georges Harik</a> (humans&amp; cofounder, Google’s 7th employee)</li>
					<li><a href="https://rauchg.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Guillermo Rauch</a> (Vercel CEO)</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</li>
		<li>
			<p>
				<a href="https://x.com/allenysu/status/2093472337912107256?a=RkWh-Vds7cDlvzuL7F4&amp;s=20" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">won 1st place</a>
				&amp; Mudra EMG bands at the
				<a href="https://x.com/clairebookworm/status/2093416760821375032?a=DPuULO1SQQ_zdoaDqp8&amp;s=20" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">axo neurotech hackathon</a>
				with <strong>Coderoach</strong>, a BCI cockroach.
			</p>
			<p>we had a cockroach play Minecraft through closed-loop steering with microstimulation.</p>
			<p>
				<a href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1VRGvbvSpiG6hd2H6ODQ8zQn_9sZnCSFkBriik4l8TCY/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">slides</a>
				<span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
				<a href="https://github.com/terezaokalova/coderoach" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github</a>
			</p>
			<a class="project-photo" href="/fun/coderoach.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View the full-size Coderoach photo">
				<img src="/fun/coderoach.png" width="516" height="462" alt="Coderoach with a small circuit board and coin-cell battery holder mounted on its back." loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
			</a>
		</li>
		<li>
			<a href="https://sciencetakehome.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">fun typing test</a>
			to maximize information transfer rate
			(<a href="/high-bit-rate.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">paper</a>)
		</li>
	</ul>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
	.fun-list { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.25rem; }
	.fun-list > li { padding-left: 0.25rem; }
	.fun-list > li + li { margin-top: 2rem; }
	.fun-list p { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
	strong { font-weight: 600; }
	.judges { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.65; }
	.judges .judges-label { margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
	.judges ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
	.judges li + li { margin-top: 0.25rem; }
	.project-photo { display: block; width: min(100%, 360px); margin-top: 1rem; }
	.project-photo img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
</style>
